{"candidateAnswer":"in 2021","evidence":"[D1:6 | 4:06 pm on 23 January, 2023] Jolene: Sorry about your loss, Deb. My mother also passed away last year. This is my room in her house, I also have many memories there. Is there anything special about it you remember?","itemId":"urn:uuid:0c8ead40-ca66-5792-8afe-93bd1014ee94","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:1d9fd10506a30c14a14de13c6974396cd17557c3bb405db0a79448427954474e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Jolene`s mother pass away?","referenceAnswer":"in 2022","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"1d9fd10506a30c14a14de13c6974396cd17557c3bb405db0a79448427954474e"}}]}